      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The תפילה נוספת לנוסע באוירון (Special Addition to the Traveler’s Prayer for Airplane Travel) was shared by the Hebrew Academy of Cleveland, Ohio many years ago as a foldable pamphlet. We are sharing it here for the posterity of an ephemeral 20th century prayer of unknown authorship and origin. If you know the author or origin of this prayer please contact us.</tei:p>
